tashnagi bali sakina ki bujhau'n kaise <br>
kat gaye haath mai mashkiza bachau'n kaise<br>
<br>
bola abbas se rehwaar haram pyasa hai <br>
apne hoton se ye paani mai lagau'n kaise<br>
<br>
sheh ne zainab se kaha margaye saqqa e haram <br>
apni masoom sakina ko batau'n kaise<br>
<br>
gham me abbas e dilawar ke kamar toot gayi <br>
mere akber mai teri laash uthau'n kaise<br>
<br>
roke kehti thi sakina ke batao ammu <br>
apne jalte huwe kurte ko bujhau'n kaise<br>
<br>
boli zainab ke sakina ki bandhi hai gardan <br>
zalimou'n se mai yateema ko chhudau'n kaise<br>
<br>
zaid ne puchha jo naize pa na hone ka sabab <br>
bole abbas mai rudaad batau'n kaise<br>
<br>
binte zehra nazar aati hai khule sar mujhko <br>
noke naiza ki bulandi pa mai jau'n kaise<br>
<br>
baal chhote hai'n mere sar pa nahi hai chadar <br>
apna chehra phupi amma mai chhupau'n kaise<br>
<br>
dhoop me lasha-e-sheh dekh ye kehti thi rabab <br>
koi batlaye to saaye me mai jaau'n kaise<br>
<br>
boli banu mere haatho'n me bandhi hai rassi <br>
tujhko asghar mai kaleje se lagau'n kaise<br>
<br>
apni khilqat huwi tabish ghame sarwar ke liye <br>
gham me shabbir ke aansu na bahau'n kaise<br>
